<http://conference#Committee_member> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee_member> .

<http://conference#Conference> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference> .

<http://conference#Conference_part> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Conference_hall> .

<http://conference#Invited_speaker> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Invited_Speaker> .

<http://conference#Organizer> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Organizator> .

<http://conference#Organizing_committee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Organizing_Committee> .

<http://conference#Paper> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Paper> .

<http://conference#Person> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Person> .

<http://conference#Program_committee> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Program_Committee> .

<http://conference#Review> owl:equivalentClass <http://sigkdd#Review> .

<http://conference#gives_presentations> owl:equivalentProperty <http://sigkdd#presentation> .

